From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:10:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 75/85] media: cedrus: Add H.264 encoding on the H616

The H616's video engine carries an H.264 encoder; expose it. Its register
differences from the V3s follow.
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
index b4d00e3..a31f2c4 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -573,7 +573,8 @@ static const struct cedrus_variant cedrus_variant_sun50i_h616 = {
 			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_H265_10_DEC |
 			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VP8_DEC |
 			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VP9_DEC |
-			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VC1_DEC,
+			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VC1_DEC |
+			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_H264_ENC,
 	.clock_mod_rate	= 600000000,
 };
 
